 <!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>WanzaBlock — Projects</title>
  <meta name="description" content="WanzaBlock's independent software projects, sports dashboards, research tools, and developer applications.">
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1020;
      color: #eef2ff;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; }
    header, main, footer { width: min(100% - 32px, 960px); margin: auto; }
    header { padding: 64px 0 36px; }
    .eyebrow { color: #8ca8ff; font-size: .85rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem); margin: 12px 0; }
    .intro { color: #b8c2dc; max-width: 620px; line-height: 1.7; }
    h2 { margin-top: 36px; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .card { display: block; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #273451; border-radius: 14px; background: #111a2e; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    .card:hover { border-color: #8ca8ff; transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: #b8c2dc; line-height: 1.6; }
    footer { padding: 40px 0; color: #9ca9c6; font-size: .9rem; }
    footer a { color: #a9bdff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="eyebrow">Independent software projects</div>
    <h1>WanzaBlock</h1>
    <p class="intro">A collection of self-hosted applications, sports dashboards, research tools, and experiments built around practical software and open technology.</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/wanzablock" style="color:#a9bdff">Explore my GitHub profile →</a></p>
  </header>
  <main>
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <a class="card" href="https://server.tailbd7d04.ts.net/">
        <h3>SKM Sports</h3>
        <p>Sports data, scores, and project dashboards.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://server.tailbd7d04.ts.net/pitchside/">
        <h3>Pitchside</h3>
        <p>A football-focused application.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://server.tailbd7d04.ts.net/nba/">
        <h3>Courtside NBA</h3>
        <p>An NBA dashboard for following games and results.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://server.tailbd7d04.ts.net/football/">
        <h3>Football Tracker</h3>
        <p>Football information and match tracking.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://server.tailbd7d04.ts.net/certificates">
        <h3>Certificate Verifier</h3>
        <p>Tools for verifying digital certificates.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="https://github.com/wanzablock">
        <h3>More projects</h3>
        <p>Browse source code and other software experiments on GitHub.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <footer>WanzaBlock · Built and maintained independently · <a href="https://github.com/wanzablock">GitHub</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
